{"seq":1,"slug":"forward-vs-deferred","title":"前向渲染与延迟渲染对比","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/realtime-rendering-pipeline/rendering-techniques/forward-vs-deferred","wordCount":1389,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"前向渲染与延迟渲染对比\">前向渲染与延迟渲染对比</h1><p>前向渲染（Forward Rendering）和延迟渲染（Deferred Rendering）是实时渲染管线的两大核心架构范式。它们对光照计算的组织方式截然不同，直接决定了引擎的性能特征、光源扩展性和材质系统复杂度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>光照计算时机</strong>：前向在几何遍历中即时计算光照，延迟将光照推迟到独立的全屏 Pass 中执行</li>\n<li><strong>复杂度模型差异</strong>：前向为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>o</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(objects \\times lights)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">bj</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ec</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，延迟为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>o</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(objects + lights \\times pixels)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">bj</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ec</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，决定了各自的扩展性边界</li>\n<li><strong>G-Buffer 编码约束</strong>：延迟渲染必须将所有材质属性压缩到固定的 G-Buffer 通道中，这限制了材质多样性但解耦了几何与光照</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前向渲染架构\">前向渲染架构</h2><p>前向渲染是最直觉的渲染路径：对每个物体、每个像素、每个光源直接计算光照。物体提交顺序通常按材质排序以减少状态切换，半透明物体按距离从后往前排序。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[遍历场景物体] --&gt; B[绑定材质/PSO]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Vertex Shader: 变换]&#10;    C --&gt; D[Fragment Shader: 逐像素光照]&#10;    D --&gt; E{多光源循环}&#10;    E --&gt;|Light 1..N| D&#10;    E --&gt;|完成| F[Output Merger: 混合写入]&#10;    F --&gt; G[帧缓冲]\">graph TD\n    A[遍历场景物体] --&gt; B[绑定材质/PSO]\n    B --&gt; C[Vertex Shader: 变换]\n    C --&gt; D[Fragment Shader: 逐像素光照]\n    D --&gt; E{多光源循环}\n    E --&gt;|Light 1..N| D\n    E --&gt;|完成| F[Output Merger: 混合写入]\n    F --&gt; G[帧缓冲]</pre><p>前向渲染的核心特征：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>复杂度</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>o</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(objects \\times lights)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">bj</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ec</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>光源上限</td>\n<td>受 Shader 常量/循环限制（通常 4-16 个主光源）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Overdraw 成本</td>\n<td>高——被遮挡像素的光照计算全部浪费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>透明物体</td>\n<td>天然支持，Alpha 混合在同一 Pass 完成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MSAA 支持</td>\n<td>直接可用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>材质灵活性</td>\n<td>每个物体可使用完全不同的 Shader</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>带宽消耗</td>\n<td>低——只写一个最终颜色 RT</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>前向渲染的变体：Forward+（Tiled Forward）</strong> 通过将屏幕划分为 Tile，在 Compute Shader 中预计算每个 Tile 影响的光源列表，然后在片段着色器中只遍历该 Tile 的光源。这将实际复杂度降为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>o</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(objects \\times lights\\_per\\_tile)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">bj</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ec</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，支持数百个动态光源同时保持前向渲染的优势。</p>\n<h2 id=\"延迟渲染架构\">延迟渲染架构</h2><p>延迟渲染将光照计算从几何遍历中分离。第一遍（Geometry Pass）只输出表面属性到 G-Buffer，不做任何光照；第二遍（Lighting Pass）以全屏方式对 G-Buffer 采样并计算所有光照。</p>\n<p><strong>Geometry Pass</strong> 使用 MRT 输出多张纹理：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>G-Buffer 通道</th>\n<th>格式</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>RT0</td>\n<td>RGBA8</td>\n<td>Albedo.rgb + Metallic</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RT1</td>\n<td>RGB10A2</td>\n<td>World Normal (Octahedral编码)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RT2</td>\n<td>RGBA8</td>\n<td>Roughness + AO + Emissive Flag</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Depth</td>\n<td>D24S8</td>\n<td>深度 + Stencil</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>Lighting Pass</strong> 对每个光源执行一次全屏或局部绘制（点光源画球体、聚光灯画锥体），从 G-Buffer 读取表面参数计算光照贡献，累加到光照缓冲中。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph Geometry Pass&#10;        A[物体绘制] --&gt; B[G-Buffer 输出]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Lighting Pass&#10;        B --&gt; C[逐光源全屏着色]&#10;        C --&gt; D[光照累加缓冲]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Post Process&#10;        D --&gt; E[色调映射]&#10;        E --&gt; F[最终输出]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph Geometry Pass\n        A[物体绘制] --&gt; B[G-Buffer 输出]\n    end\n    subgraph Lighting Pass\n        B --&gt; C[逐光源全屏着色]\n        C --&gt; D[光照累加缓冲]\n    end\n    subgraph Post Process\n        D --&gt; E[色调映射]\n        E --&gt; F[最终输出]\n    end</pre><p>延迟渲染的复杂度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>o</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(objects + lights \\times pixels\\_affected)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">bj</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ec</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ec</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>——光照成本与物体数量解耦，支持上千个动态光源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"两种架构的核心权衡\">两种架构的核心权衡</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>前向渲染</th>\n<th>延迟渲染</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>光源扩展性</td>\n<td>差（受限于 Shader 循环）</td>\n<td>优（线性增长）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>带宽消耗</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高（G-Buffer 读写）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>透明物体</td>\n<td>直接支持</td>\n<td>需额外 Forward Pass</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MSAA</td>\n<td>直接可用</td>\n<td>复杂（需 per-sample shading）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>材质多样性</td>\n<td>无限制</td>\n<td>受 G-Buffer 编码限制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>着色器复杂度</td>\n<td>高（材质+光照耦合）</td>\n<td>解耦（几何与光照分离）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Overdraw 浪费</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低（Geometry Pass 有深度剔除）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GPU 显存占用</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高（多张全屏纹理）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>延迟渲染的最大限制是 G-Buffer 的固定编码——所有材质必须将表面属性压缩到预定义的通道中。特殊材质（各向异性、次表面散射、双面叶片）需要额外的 G-Buffer 通道或特殊编码，增加了系统复杂度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"混合渲染策略\">混合渲染策略</h2><p>实际引擎几乎不使用纯粹的前向或延迟方案，而是根据物体类型采用混合策略：</p>\n<p><strong>不透明物体</strong>：延迟渲染处理，利用其光源扩展性和 Overdraw 免疫优势</p>\n<p><strong>透明物体</strong>：前向渲染处理，因为延迟渲染无法自然表达半透明混合</p>\n<p><strong>特殊材质</strong>：前向渲染处理，绕过 G-Buffer 编码限制</p>\n<p><strong>天空盒/粒子</strong>：前向渲染，在延迟光照 Pass 之后绘制</p>\n<p>Unreal Engine 5 的默认管线就是这种混合架构：大部分几何通过延迟路径，标记为 Translucent 或 Custom 的材质走前向路径。Unity HDRP 同样提供这两种渲染路径的混合使用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"visibility-buffer-第三条路径\">Visibility Buffer：第三条路径</h2><p>2024-2026 年间，Visibility Buffer（V-Buffer）方案逐渐进入主流视野。它在 Geometry Pass 只输出三角形 ID 和重心坐标到一张轻量纹理（通常 64bit/pixel），光照 Pass 通过三角形 ID 反查顶点数据并执行完整着色。</p>\n<p>V-Buffer 的优势：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>G-Buffer 带宽极低（只存 ID + 重心坐标）</li>\n<li>对材质类型无任何限制（着色在 Lighting Pass 按需计算）</li>\n<li>天然支持 GPU-Driven Rendering 的间接绘制模式</li>\n<li>适配 Nanite 等虚拟几何体系统（三角形级别的细粒度渲染）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>V-Buffer 的代价是 Lighting Pass 需要随机访问顶点缓冲和材质数据，对 GPU 的缓存命中率提出更高要求。它代表了渲染架构向「先确定可见性，再按需着色」方向的进化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>前向和延迟渲染代表了光照组织方式的两种极端策略，实际引擎普遍采用混合方案：不透明物体走延迟路径获取光源扩展性，透明和特殊材质走前向路径保持灵活性。Visibility Buffer 作为新兴的第三条路径，以极低的 G-Buffer 带宽和无限制的材质支持，正在成为 GPU-Driven 架构下的首选方案。</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p>相关文档：<a href=\"physically-based-rendering\">基于物理的渲染</a> 详解光照 Pass 中 PBR 模型的实现细节。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"前向渲染与延迟渲染对比","id":"前向渲染与延迟渲染对比"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"前向渲染架构","id":"前向渲染架构"},{"level":2,"text":"延迟渲染架构","id":"延迟渲染架构"},{"level":2,"text":"两种架构的核心权衡","id":"两种架构的核心权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"混合渲染策略","id":"混合渲染策略"},{"level":2,"text":"Visibility Buffer：第三条路径","id":"visibility-buffer-第三条路径"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"光栅化与片段处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/realtime-rendering-pipeline/pipeline-architecture/rasterization-fragment"},"next":{"title":"基于物理的渲染（PBR）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/realtime-rendering-pipeline/rendering-techniques/physically-based-rendering"}}